{% comment %}
  ================================================================================
  SURGEONS SECURITY & PERFORMANCE SUITE v2.0
  ================================================================================

  Integrated security and performance optimization layer for surgeonsolution.io
  Leverages surgeonsolutions.org infrastructure for:
  - Edge CDN asset delivery
  - Script optimization API
  - WAF / SQL injection protection
  - Enhanced security headers
  - Real-time threat detection

  Organization: CBD Surgeons & Surgeons, LLC
  Operator: Ryan Bolda - 130 Dickinson St, Mount Clemens, MI 48043

  DEPLOYMENT COMMANDS:
  - Development: shopify theme dev --store=cbdsurgeons.myshopify.com
  - Preview: shopify theme push --unpublished
  - Production: shopify theme push --live

  Last Updated: 2026-01-16
